{
  "milestone": "M15.522",
  "title": "ROM World Rolling/Sliding Crusher & Ceiling Crusher Traps",
  "range": {
    "start": "0x0173D6",
    "end": "0x01778C",
    "size_bytes": 950
  },
  "routines": [
    {
      "name": "AI_WorldObject_RollingSlidingBoulder_Crusher",
      "start": "0x0173D6",
      "end": "0x017528",
      "size_bytes": 338,
      "instruction_count": 84,
      "description": "Rolling / sliding boulder or crusher hazard. Dispatches on mode +$9E (0,1,2,3,4,5). Mode 0 (Idle): increments ticker +$2E while velocity deltas +$72|+$76 == 0. Mode 5 (Spawn Init): sets +$37 = 0x40, clears flying bit +$38:7, sets +$38:2, anim +$2A = 2, mode +$9E = 1, clears facing +$16, sets velocities +$4E = +$A0, +$52 = +$8C. Mode 1 (Rolling / Sliding Motion): copies velocities to deltas +$72/+$76, tests wall collision (+$40|+$41)&0x40 -> on wall collision triggers impact (anim 4, mode 2, screen shake $FF17C4 = 4, SFX #$800346). Else runs AABB collision test 0x00B922 [-16..+16, -16..+16, 0..32] vs player: inflicts 20 HP damage ($8014), upward impulse vz = $10000, transfers velocities +$4E/+$52, computes facing via 0x00E338, plays SFX #$800346 (#$900237 for Ali), transitions to wall impact. Mode 2 (Shatter / Despawn): when animation finished +$37:1 != 0, despawns entity (+0 = 0)."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_WorldObject_CeilingCrusher_Respawning",
      "start": "0x017528",
      "end": "0x017634",
      "size_bytes": 268,
      "instruction_count": 70,
      "description": "Persistent-bit-triggered respawning ceiling crusher. Mode +$9E == 3, sub-state +$A6 (0..3). Sub-state 0 (Raised Ceiling Wait): sets anim +$2A = 6, z = +$8C, sets flag +$36:3. Polls persistent room bit via 0x018030: when set, advances +$A6 = 1 and sets drop timer +$2 = +$A0. Sub-state 1 (Countdown to Drop): decrements +$2. When 0: advances +$A6 = 2, clears vz +$56, clears +$36:3, sets +$36:2, clears shadow scale +$3D = 0, snaps position x = $FF19F0, y = $FF19F4 + 1 to target player, plays drop SFX #$800350. Sub-state 2 (Falling & Ground Impact): computes dynamic shadow scale +$3D = (3 - min(z >> 6, 3)) << 3, applies gravity vz -= $C000, integrates z += vz. On ground impact (z < 0): advances +$A6 = 3, clamps z = 0, sets flying bit +$38:2, anim +$2A = 4, triggers screen shake $FF17C4 = 4, plays impact SFX #$800346. Runs AABB collision test [-16..+16, -16..+16, 0..32] vs player calling heavy crush damage 0x017722. Sub-state 3 (Reset / Retract): on anim finished +$37:1 != 0, clears +$A6 = 0, clears +$38:2, and loops back to Sub-state 0 to raise back up."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI_WorldObject_CeilingCrusher_OneShot",
      "start": "0x017634",
      "end": "0x017722",
      "size_bytes": 238,
      "instruction_count": 64,
      "description": "Persistent-bit-triggered one-shot ceiling crusher. Mode +$9E == 4, sub-state +$A6 (0..3). Identical to respawning crusher with two critical distinctions: 1) Sub-state 1 drop initiation drops at its fixed placement without snapping x,y to player coordinates. 2) Sub-state 3 on impact animation finished despawns entity (+0 = 0) permanently instead of resetting."
    },
    {
      "name": "Object_HeavyCrush_DamageCallback",
      "start": "0x017722",
      "end": "0x01778C",
      "size_bytes": 106,
      "instruction_count": 24,
      "description": "Heavy crush damage collision callback routine. Verifies target vulnerability (checks invulnerability +$38:3, special immunity +$3A:0, and cooldown +$82). Sets attacker reference +$7E = a6, deals massive 40 HP crush damage (+$86 = $8028), clears defense cooldowns/flags (+$82 = 0, +$83 = 0, +$9D = 0), applies upward launch vz = $8000, z += 1, zeroes target horizontal velocity (+$4E = 0, +$52 = 0), sets knockback facing +$84 from target orientation +$16, and plays SFX #$900237 for Ali (+0 == 2) or #$800346 for other entities."
    }
  ],
